---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = "Is AI Automation Secure? How We Protect Your Business Data | PresciaIQ Insights";
const description = "Connecting AI to your internal systems requires strict security protocols. Here is how PresciaIQ ensures your data remains private and protected.";
const canonicalURL = new URL("/insights/ai-automation-security-privacy/", Astro.site).href;
const date = "2026-08-12";
const category = "AI Automations";

const schema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BlogPosting",
  "headline": title,
  "description": description,
  "image": "https://www.presciaiq.com.au/og-image.jpg",
  "author": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "PresciaIQ",
    "url": "https://www.presciaiq.com.au"
  },
  "publisher": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "PresciaIQ",
    "logo": {
      "@type": "ImageObject",
      "url": "https://www.presciaiq.com.au/logo.png"
    }
  },
  "datePublished": date,
  "dateModified": date,
  "mainEntityOfPage": {
    "@type": "WebPage",
    "@id": canonicalURL
  }
};
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} canonicalURL={canonicalURL}>
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(schema)} />

  <main class="min-h-screen bg-background text-foreground py-24">
    <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mb-12">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
          <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono font-semibold text-primary border border-primary/20 bg-primary/5">{category}</span>
          <time class="text-sm text-muted-foreground font-sans">{new Date(date).toLocaleDateString('en-AU', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' })}</time>
        </div>
        <h1 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-foreground mb-6 leading-tight">{title}</h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-muted-foreground font-sans leading-relaxed">{description}</p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-invert prose-lg max-w-none font-sans">
        <p>The biggest hesitation Australian businesses have regarding AI automation is data security. If an AI agent is reading your emails, processing your invoices, or answering your customer queries, how do you ensure that sensitive information is not leaked or used to train public models?</p><p>It is a valid concern, and it is why PresciaIQ builds enterprise-grade security into every automation. We use zero-retention API endpoints, meaning the AI models process the data and immediately discard it. We deploy models within secure, isolated cloud environments (such as AWS Sydney or Azure) to ensure data sovereignty compliance. And we strictly utilise enterprise API agreements that explicitly prohibit the LLM providers (like OpenAI or Anthropic) from using your data for model training.</p><p>Automation should accelerate your business, not expose it to risk. Our architecture ensures your proprietary data remains exactly that — proprietary.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-white/10">
        <div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center">
          <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-4">Ready to automate your operations?</h3>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground mb-6">Book a scoping call with our team to discuss how custom AI automations can eliminate manual work in your business.</p>
          <a href="/start" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-primary text-primary-foreground font-semibold text-sm hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(0,255,136,0.3)] transition-all duration-300">
            Book a Scoping Call →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>
